# REVIEW EXAMPLE ONLY. The station SSH owner must independently verify
# one approved key -> one dedicated, unprivileged UID and forbid alternate
# login paths for that UID. Adapt Match User to the exact system account.
Match User @REVIEWED_DEDICATED_BRIDGE_ACCOUNT@
    AuthenticationMethods publickey
    PasswordAuthentication no
    KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
    PermitTTY no
    AllowTcpForwarding no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no
    PermitTunnel no
    PermitUserRC no
    PermitUserEnvironment no
    ForceCommand @EXACT_ATTESTED_PYTHON@ -I -m zog.root_control.issuer_cross_host ssh-bridge

# AuthorizedKeysFile must be separately protected, contain exactly one
# operator-approved transport key, and have no alternative key providers.
# The key restriction must independently include restrict/no-pty/no-* forwarding.
# This file does not provision any account or enable sshd.
